    fits: 1/L: 1.000000 res=6.7e-16 ADM dof=2 ; logL: -- res=2.2e-16 ADM dof=2 b=-5.612e-17; 1/L,1/L^2: 1.000000 res=2.2e-16 ADM dof=1 ; h^p: 1.000000 res=0.0e+00 ADM dof=1 p=0.21  [admissible: 1/L (dof 2), 1/L,1/L^2 (dof 1), h^p (dof 1)]  [logL also admissible: divergence not excluded]
